sequenceDiagram
 participant IDE as Client / IDE
 participant Agent as Coding Agent
 participant Workspace as Workspace Gate
 participant User as Permission UI
 IDE->>Agent: initialize(version, capabilities)
 Agent-->>IDE: negotiated version + capabilities
 IDE->>Agent: session/new(cwd, roots, MCP config)
 IDE->>Agent: session/prompt(parts)
 Agent-->>IDE: session/update(agent message, tool_call_update)
 Agent->>Workspace: read/write within negotiated roots
 Agent->>User: session/request_permission(exact command/path)
 User-->>Agent: selected allow option or cancelled
 Agent-->>IDE: terminal_update / tool_call_update / diff
 IDE->>Agent: session/resume(replayFrom?)
 Agent-->>IDE: current snapshot + optional ordered replay
 IDE->>Agent: session/cancel or tool_call/cancel
